  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "深夜总编室的广告危机  (Midnight Crisis Over a Fraudulent Ad)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Staying alone on night duty in the chief editor's office, Bu Xiaogu answers an urgent phone call from an advertising representative about a fraudulent product ad. Listen to their Mandarin call first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您好，这里是星天总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思，淳于总制作人不在，请问您有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们星天好几档节目的广告，都是我们公司代理的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个我知道，请问您有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "有一条中插广告，现在涉嫌产品虚假。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们星天和我们公司，现在都受到了牵连。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这件事对你们节目的影响应该更大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们是专业的广告公司，怎么会出这种事呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请问您贵姓？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我会把这件事情转达给淳于总的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天一定会处理好这件事情，但也需要你们公司的配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好，那就先这样，之后再联系。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您好，这里是星天总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, this is Xingtian's chief editor office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思，淳于总制作人不在，请问您有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry, Chief Producer Chun Yuqiao is out; how may I help you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们星天好几档节目的广告，都是我们公司代理的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our agency handles the advertising placements for several of Xingtian's shows.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这个我知道，请问您有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am aware of that; could you tell me what happened?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "有一条中插广告，现在涉嫌产品虚假。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One of the mid-roll embedded commercials is now suspected of product fraud.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们星天和我们公司，现在都受到了牵连。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both Xingtian and our agency have now been implicated.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这件事对你们节目的影响应该更大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The fallout on your programme is likely even more serious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们是专业的广告公司，怎么会出这种事呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are a professional advertising firm, so how could something like this happen?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请问您贵姓？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'May I ask your surname?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我会把这件事情转达给淳于总的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will pass this matter along to Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天一定会处理好这件事情，但也需要你们公司的配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian will definitely handle this properly, though we also need your company's cooperation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好，那就先这样，之后再联系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, let us leave it there for now and stay in touch.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您好，这里是星天总编室。",
      "gap": 0.5
