      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我会把这件事情转达给淳于总的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天一定会处理好这件事情，但也需要你们公司的配合。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好，那就先这样，之后再联系。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Keeping her composure under pressure, Xiaogu promises Xingtian will resolve the crisis properly and stays up all night drafting an action plan. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
